OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over death of elderly
OL,4,Awoman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of an 88-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman.
OL,10,FJill Gant was found dead at a property
OL,11,Fon Appleford Drive in Abingdon,
OL,12,FOxfordshire, at about 14:20 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThames Valley Police said Daniel Boore,
OL,16,F36 and also of Appleford Drive, was due
OL,17,Fto appear at High Wycombe Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
