OL,6,FThe force said specially trained
OL,7,Fofficers continued to support her
OL,8,Ffamily and urged anyone with any
OL,9,Finformation to come forward or speak to
OL,10,Fneighbourhood officers who remain in
OL,11,Fthe area.
